    "text": "You won\u2019t be able to connect again with any\\nplayer you add to your block list.\\c\\nAre you sure you want to block this player?\\n(It\u2019s possible to unblock the player again.)"
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "The other player has been added to your\\nblock list. The trade will end.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
